read of the bucket (`middleware/rateLimitEnforce.ts:112` and `:141`) was read. The reference test `ks480-connector-auth.test.ts`
(135 lines, the test that drives the REAL `authenticateToken` API-key branch with `fetch` stubbed) was read. KS-1205 (0 comments)
was read. This brief takes ONE of its test-only rows, F-3 G-BUCKET-HASH. **PRE-MEASURED** in a scratch clone at the tip; see
