## THE MODE - read this twice

TEST-ONLY, ONE NEW FILE. Your diff contains EXACTLY ONE file: the NEW test file
`Blockchain/Dev/services/api-gateway/src/__tests__/ks1205-api-gateway-per-key-limiter-follow.test.ts`, written as
`--- /dev/null` then `+++ b/...`, one `@@ -0,0 +1,77 @@` hunk, every line `+`.
**Do NOT modify `middleware/auth.ts`**, do NOT modify `middleware/rateLimitEnforce.ts`, and do NOT modify
`ks480-connector-auth.test.ts` (the reference test). `auth.ts` is in files[...] only so you can see the branch the new test drives.
The checker plants the tamper named at the bottom into a clone of `auth.ts` and expects the red cell RED and the control GREEN,
